#: ../../deprecations/pending-removal-in-3.14.rst:22
msgid ":mod:`asyncio`:"
msgstr ":mod:`asyncio`:"

#: ../../deprecations/pending-removal-in-3.14.rst:24
msgid ""
"The child watcher classes :class:`!asyncio.MultiLoopChildWatcher`, "
":class:`!asyncio.FastChildWatcher`, :class:`!asyncio.AbstractChildWatcher` "
"and :class:`!asyncio.SafeChildWatcher` are deprecated and will be removed in"
" Python 3.14. (Contributed by Kumar Aditya in :gh:`94597`.)"
msgstr ""
"Třídy pozorovatelů potomků :class:`!asyncio.MultiLoopChildWatcher`, "
":class:`!asyncio.FastChildWatcher`, :class:`!asyncio.AbstractChildWatcher` a"
" :class:`!asyncio.SafeChildWatcher` jsou zastaralé a budou odstraněny v "
"Pythonu 3.14. (Přispěl Kumar Aditya v :gh:`94597`.)"

#: ../../deprecations/pending-removal-in-3.14.rst:30
msgid ""
":func:`!asyncio.set_child_watcher`, :func:`!asyncio.get_child_watcher`, "
":meth:`!asyncio.AbstractEventLoopPolicy.set_child_watcher` and "
":meth:`!asyncio.AbstractEventLoopPolicy.get_child_watcher` are deprecated "
"and will be removed in Python 3.14. (Contributed by Kumar Aditya in "
":gh:`94597`.)"
msgstr ""
"Funkce :func:`!asyncio.set_child_watcher`, "
":func:`!asyncio.get_child_watcher`, "
":meth:`!asyncio.AbstractEventLoopPolicy.set_child_watcher` a "
":meth:`!asyncio.AbstractEventLoopPolicy.get_child_watcher` jsou zastaralé a "
"budou odstraněny v Pythonu 3.14. (Přispěl Kumar Aditya v :gh:`94597`.)"

#: ../../deprecations/pending-removal-in-3.14.rst:36
msgid ""
"The :meth:`~asyncio.get_event_loop` method of the default event loop policy "
"now emits a :exc:`DeprecationWarning` if there is no current event loop set "
"and it decides to create one. (Contributed by Serhiy Storchaka and Guido van"
" Rossum in :gh:`100160`.)"
msgstr ""
"Metoda :meth:`~asyncio.get_event_loop` výchozí politiky event loop nyní "
"vyvolává :exc:`DeprecationWarning`, pokud není nastavena aktuální event loop"
" a rozhodne se ji vytvořit. (Přispěli Serhiy Storchaka a Guido van Rossum v "
":gh:`100160`.)"

#: ../../deprecations/pending-removal-in-3.14.rst:41
msgid ""
":mod:`email`: Deprecated the *isdst* parameter in "
":func:`email.utils.localtime`. (Contributed by Alan Williams in "
